    {"fact": "The council's 2026-27 calendar counts 74 days in autumn, 54 in spring and 67 in summer: 195 days in total, including 5 PD days.", "source": "https://www.bedford.gov.uk/files/term-dates-2026-27.pdf/download?inline"},
